  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f2bed5e614b0dd34485c43fa9f9413fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 00_YourLabIsReady
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subject: "Your Lab Is Ready \u2013 Let\u2019s Begin!"
  sender: Message
  content: "Dear Student,\n\nGood news! I\u2019ve found you a small test lab to work
    in. It may be a bit disorganized (the last users weren\u2019t exactly\ntidy),
    but it\u2019s equipped and ready for your battery cell experiments.\n\nYour professors
    are keen for you to get hands-on experience with electrochemical testing, and
    you\u2019ll be working\nwith a PAT-Cell\xAE. The process is simple, but precision
    matters:\n\n1. Assemble the PAT-Cell\xAE inside the vacuum chamber (there\u2019s
    a schematic somewhere in the lab).\n2. Place the assembled cell into the test
    chamber (that\u2019s the big blue oven).\n3. Set the parameters and hit \u201CStart.\u201D\n4.
    That\u2019s it!\n\nJust a quick heads-up: some of the components you\u2019ll
    need might not be in their proper places. They\u2019re supposed\nto be stored
    in the wall rack, but previous users may have left parts in drawers, on desks,
    or wherever they last\nused them\u2014so you might need to do a bit of searching.\n\nI\u2019ll
    be sending you follow-up emails explaining each step in more detail. If you ever
    feel stuck, just check your\ninbox\u2014the emails should guide you through.\n\nYour
    favorite docent,\n\nH. Graunt!\n\nP.S.: You can receive emails on any of the
    terminals, they\u2019re all signed in to the guest user by default."
  maxMailSize: 220
